  "source_corrections": [
    "No UIFont contract exists in current HMOS shared modules, but the actual Windows workbench_host source contains a reusable Rust FontPreference contract and core/CAS storage.",
    "Mobile UIContext getSystemFontList is documented to return an empty array; an empty enumeration must not reject valid typed family names.",
    "UIContext Font.registerFont returns void while documented asynchronous and non-concurrent; normal return is not a load or glyph ACK.",
    "API26 graphics text FontCollection.loadFontWithCheck returns a Promise with parser errors. Installed official Huawei examples show global collection and ArkUI Text.fontFamily together.",
    "Flutter SFNT validation is bounded structural validation, not complete font semantics; zero-length tables are accepted.",
    "Windows temp flush and rename do not establish directory fsync or every crash/close cleanup guarantee.",
    "Core font metadata does not itself prove font asset migration or import/export support."
  ],
